Package: mudi-volte
Version: @VERSION@-1
Depends: libc
Source: MudiVoLTE
License: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
Section: net
Architecture: aarch64_cortex-a53
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: VoLTE calls on the GL.iNet Mudi 7 through SIP phones on its Wi-Fi.
 Switches the Quectel RG650V to its External VoLTE Stack mode, registers the
 SIM in the operator's IMS from the router itself and bridges calls to SIP
 apps such as Linphone on phones connected to the router. Phones are set up
 by scanning a QR code; the web page is under LuCI > Services > Calls & SMS.
